Package: iQualityR.core
Title: Core Components for the iQualityR Quality Engineering Framework
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Zhiming", family = "Chen", email = "zhimingc383@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Foundational infrastructure for the iQualityR quality engineering framework. Provides R6 abstract base classes for plans, tasks, analyzers, plotters, and reporters; a unified ggplot2 theme system with built-in palettes; Excel export utilities; metadata management following a 4M1E convention (Man, Machine, Material, Method, Environment); simple internationalization (en-US, zh-CN); and utility functions for validation, formatting, and configuration.
